# Combat UI

Render the authoritative combat snapshot. Submit only `engageCombat`, `playCard`, `useBasicAttack`, `useBasicBlock`, `useSupply`, and `endTurn`.

While `awaitingEngage` is true, show the Engage acknowledgement and lock other combat actions. Must stay visible: current actor, AP, HP/Mana/Stamina, card costs, initiative timeline, next enemy intents (timeline and hostile standees), Basics, draw/discard/exhaust counts. Color is never the only signal.

Do not compute damage, initiative, or targeting legality locally. Interaction lock during turn playback and the Engage beat is view state only.
